# Vandeta MITM payload - watch the network, redirect nobody.
#
# No page, no redirect and no DNS rule: every request keeps going to its real
# server through the forwarding bridge, while the run feed lists the domains as
# they are visited ("dns query ...", "GET host (no rule)"). Use it to map what a
# network is doing, or to prove the attack path before arming a real payload.
#
#   WiFi > Wifi Atks > MITM Attack > Payload > recon.mitm > Start

# Keep the victims online: without the bridge their traffic dies at the board,
# and a dead network is not a network you can watch.
forward auto

# What the board landed on, then who actually answered ARP.
info
probe all
